  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a metalworking cooperative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EFAMED will work with graduates of its vocational training school based in Jrmie to launch a metalworking cooperative producing industrial doors, windows and gates, and agricultural tools. The project is expected to provide a steady source of income for 50 young men and its products will benefit the entire department of Grand&apos;Anse.</narrative>
  </description>
